,"\"3.1118\"","\"5.2055\"","\"5.6115\"","\"8.7233\"","\"3.0245\"","\".0514\"","\"3.6942\"","\"3.7858\"","\".0916\"","\"gratuity\"","\"msme_interest\"","\"investment_profit\"","\"bad_debt\"","\"other_noncurrent\"","\"tax_paid\"","\"reported_cfo\"","\"cash_capex\"","\"securities_net\"","\"principal_paid\"","\"opening_cash\"","\"closing_cash\"","\".0208\"","\".0244\"","\"-.0265\"","\".0033\"","\"-7.2932\"","\"1.6915\"","\"-.0042\"","\".5436\"","\"2.0760\"","\"-7.6982\"","\".0265\"","\".6722\"","\"1.3686\"","\"Do not invent adjusted CFO. Loan/advance cash inflow conflicts with rising balance; tax paid conflicts with current charge/provisions. Rounding residual .0001cr retained.\"","\"COCO\"","\"FOFO\"","\"online\"","\"B2B\"","\".8031\"","\"8.6782\"","\"10.1803\"","\".3139\"","\"3.3169\"","\"12.2332\"","\"17.7780\"","\".8696\"","\"10.9587\"","\"20.0160\"","\"14.8561\"","\".5135\"","\"13.2717\"","\"24.8440\"","\"16.8939\"","\"S02 PDF141-144; sell-in not consumer GMV. FY24 and 9M channel sums differ from net-products table by .0001cr rounding. FY24 printed percentage columns not internally consistent.\"","\"operating_advances\"","\"operating_noncurrent_assets\"","\"operating_accruals_including_customer_advances\"","\"employee_provisions\"","\"excluded_tax_assets\"","\"excluded_ipo_prepay\"","\"source\"","\"2.0077\"","\".0583\"","\".5819\"","\".0971\"","\".2216\"","\"S02 annexures8/11/12/16/20; current advances less government/TDS; other liabilities less borrowing/MSME interest\"","\"1.2825\"","\".1074\"","\"1.5105\"","\".2163\"","\".2942\"","\"S02 same annexures; rounding differences retained\"","\"2.1054\"","\".1566\"","\"1.6660\"","\".3431\"","\".2387\"","\"S02 restated; does not use S01 comparator reclassifications\"","\"3.7205\"","\".1608\"","\"3.7251\"","\".3639\"","\".0789\"","\"S01 notes9/10/14/18 and long-term provisions; includes employee advances, excludes tax and IPOprepay, excludes borrowing/MSMEinterest from operating accruals\"","\"caps\"","\"maximum\"","\"CASH3 and persistent weak conversion. Cap does not impute missing EARN or CAP.\"","\"id\"","\"topic\"","\"source_locator\"","\"finding\"","\"A01\"","\"FY26 main and IFC reports\"","\"S01 PDF120-133\"","\"Unmodified main and IFC opinions, not a guarantee of clean records; audit covers financial statements.\"","\"A02\"","\"FY26 CARO drafting residue\"","\"S01 PDF124\"","\"An unresolved instruction asks that draft conclusions be checked against issuer audit evidence before signing. Request corrected final report and auditor explanation; not proof of misstatement.\"","\"A03\"","\"Managerial remuneration scope\"","\"S01 PDF122\"","\"Auditor could not comment on Section197(16) adequacy of profits because conversion-date accounts were not supplied.\"","\"A04\"","\"Bank reporting discrepancies\"","\"S01 PDF152 Note35\"","\"Bank net-current-asset returns differ from books: Mar26 21.3850 versus19.0966cr, gap2.2884cr; Jun25gap3.3755cr. CARO working-capital threshold language does not resolve this.\"","\"A05\"","\"Tax note mismatch\"","\"S01 PDF135/148\"","\"Tax note3.6942cr includes prior credit.0916; P&L3.7858/PAT11.2248 excludes that credit. No unsupported correction made.\"","\"A06\"","\"Cash-flow reconciliation missing\"","\"S01 PDF134/136\"","\"Advances inflow1.6915cr versus short-term advances rising1.8585cr; tax paid7.6982cr versus current charge3.8962 and provision falling.3437. Possible offsetting reclassification; adjusted CFO ND.\"","\"A07\"","\"Equity and issue wording\"","\"S01 PDF128/141; S02 cover/IPOterms\"","\"CARO private placement wording conflicts with bonus-only equity reconciliation; IPO note wrongly calls158premium versus verified158total/148premium.\"","\"A08\"","\"Restatements and comparators\"","\"S02 PDF201/252-253; S01 PDF134-136\"","\"FY23-25 PAT/equity changed; FY26 opening retained earnings adds.0514cr but comparator financial columns largely original. Keep vintages explicit.\"","\"A09\"","\"FY24 audit trail exception\"","\"S06 PDF1-5 visually reviewed\"","\"Unmodified BS/P&L/notes opinion by Samarth M. Surana dated2Sep2024. Three branches lacked edit-log capability throughout FY24; auditor could not comment there, and proper-books clause excepts that matter. CARO exempt, no separate IFC opinion, no CF statement scope.\"","\"A10\"","\"FY23 original pack incomplete\"","\"S05 all15pages reviewed\"","\"Posted pack contains management/Board/AGM and tax material, not actual statutory audit or full financials. Board assertion of no qualification is not independent audit verification. S02 restated auditor separately covers FY23.\"","\"A11\"","\"FY22 and FY25 original audit history\"","\"S04/S03\"","\"Originals independently reviewed. FY22 S04 PDF4-7: unmodified BS/P&L/notes only, CARO exempt, no separate IFC positive opinion; Samarth M. Surana/Bharat Rattan,21Sep2022. FY25 S03 PDF39-47: unmodified BS/P&L/CFO, CARO reports no default/fraud/fresh allotment/loans or investments/auditor resignation duringFY25; edit-log operated and preserved. No standalone positive IFC opinion inferred from generic responsibilities.\"","\"A12\"","\"MSME and related-party controls\"","\"S01 PDF151-153\"","\"MSME interest payable.1133cr versus.0487cr; director compensation FY26 1.6925cr versus RPT1.6926 rounding, FY25 employee note1.0050 versus RPT1.1610 materially different. Need bridges.\"","\"A13\"","\"Accounting basis and contingent exposures\"","\"S01 accountingpolicy and notes\"","\"AS, not IndAS. Operating leases already expensed; do not add synthetic lease debt and leave rent unchanged. Legal/tax contingencies and guarantees need prospectus review; no undisclosed amount is set to zero.\"","\"A14\"","\"Paid private-placement compliance penalties and litigation\"","\"S02 printed30-32 and262 onward\"","\"Company disclosed early use of subscription funds before formal Board allotment, third-party remittance mismatch and late PAS3 for2023 issue. ROC18Dec2025 penalties: company2.00+.23lakh, RahulSachdeva1.00+.23lakh and DheerajBansal1.00+.23lakh; disclosed paid with no pending proceeding. Company claimant in criminal case4.03lakh; promoter two tax demands1.38lakh. Not a finding of fraud; do not erase governance significance because penalties small.\"","\"url\"","\"retrieved\"","\"availability_cutoff\"","\"limitation\"","\"S01\"","\"annual2026\"","\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0477/3327/6826/files/Recode_05th_AGM_Notice_Annual_Report_for_the_FY_2025-26.pdf?v=1788870583\"","\"2026-10-23\"","\"2026-10-20\"","\"dc28c328b5c80962d16e94caa54a741f1e305419371bdae3a592b8aecdcb5249\"","3632448","\"READ\"","\"Original source retained privately for research; archive contains authored structured observations, not original documents.\"","\"S03\"","\"annual2025\"","\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0477/3327/6826/files/Annual_Report_2024-25.pdf?v=1778332302\"","\"b2691201e17102892efd2db0e26bf9c0950eae18c97963e56cb0d1f5b36be10f\"","3902557","\"S02\"","\"prospectus\"","\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0477/3327/6826/files/FINAL_PROSPECTUS_RSL.pdf?v=1778249586\"","\"256fcabd143cac1cd1b0ee3a96667da717bf58535b5fa6ee0e6f87d3d3c0e015\"","7405560","\"S08\"","\"security\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/interop/NSE_CM_security_19102026.csv.gz\"","\"d3665d120c8b0379df3483321ad45f8230535c7124b9759de5c29961df326898\"","1550630","\"X01\"","\"market\"","\"https://www.bseindia.com/download/BhavCopy/Equity/BhavCopy_BSE_CM_0_0_0_20261019_F_0000.CSV\"","\"HTTP_403_INACCESSIBLE\"","\"Ordinary public-server HTTP response, not a policy denial. Not substituted with invented facts.\"","\"X02\"","\"listing\"","\"https://www.bseindia.com/markets/MarketInfo/DispNewNoticesCirculars.aspx?page=20260511-46\"","\"S04\"","\"annual2022\"","\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0477/3327/6826/files/21-22_-_FINANCIAL_STATEMENT.pdf?v=1766659762\"","\"3f807c912382b649f9b13578271d4928372eefe63a47f4a94fc0015be6a80b44\"","1330403","\"S05\"","\"annual2023\"","\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0477/3327/6826/files/22-23_-_DIREC